## 2. Assembly Definition (.asmdef) 分区

### 2.1 分区原则

- 每个功能模块**必须**有自己的 `.asmdef`
- 依赖方向：`Gameplay → Core`，`UI → Core`，`Gameplay ↛ UI`（严格单向）
- 测试程序集与生产代码分离

### 2.2 推荐程序集结构

```
Scripts/
├── Core/               → Company.Game.Core.asmdef
├── Gameplay/           → Company.Game.Gameplay.asmdef (引用 Core)
├── UI/                 → Company.Game.UI.asmdef (引用 Core)
├── Networking/         → Company.Game.Networking.asmdef (引用 Core, Gameplay)
├── Engine/             → Company.Game.Engine.asmdef (引用 Core)
└── Tests/
    ├── EditMode/       → Company.Game.Tests.EditMode.asmdef (引用 Core, Gameplay)
    └── PlayMode/       → Company.Game.Tests.PlayMode.asmdef (引用 Core, Gameplay)
```

### 2.3 .asmdef 配置要点

✅ **正确**：
```json
{
    "name": "Company.Game.Gameplay",
    "rootNamespace": "Company.Game.Gameplay",
    "references": ["Company.Game.Core"],
    "includePlatforms": [],
    "excludePlatforms": [],
    "allowUnsafeCode": false,
    "overrideReferences": false,
    "precompiledReferences": [],
    "autoReferenced": true,
    "defineConstraints": [],
    "versionDefines": [],
    "noEngineReferences": false
}
```

❌ **错误**：
```json
{
    "name": "Gameplay",  // 违规：无公司前缀，命名空间冲突风险
    "references": [],     // 违规：未显式声明依赖
    "allowUnsafeCode": true  // 违规：除非有 team-level 审批
}
```

